n31: \n32: # unbind = ALT, SPACE\n33: bindd = SUPER, SPACE, Launch apps, exec, launch-app\n34: \n35: # Logitech MX Keys\n36: # bind = SUPER SHIFT, S, exec, omarchy-capture-screenshot      # Print Screen Button\n37: # bind = SUPER, H, exec, voxtype record toggle                 # Dictation Button\n38: # bind = SUPER, PERIOD, exec, omarchy-launch-walker -m symbols # Emoji Button\n\n(End of file - total 38 lines)\n</content>",
